# Commits

Only commit when the owner asks.

- Message is **one line only**. Clear, specific, written for a human reading `git log`
- No body, no trailer, no `Co-authored-by`, no `Made-with`, no extra metadata
- Pass the message via HEREDOC so it cannot pick up a second line

```bash
git commit -m "$(cat <<'EOF'
Rebuild the pressing bin as a record-shop album row.
EOF
)"
```
